WEBVTT

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:32.500
Phantom pain...

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.250
I have no arms, and yet sometimes
they ache when I awaken.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:40.792
Something bad always
happens on a day like this.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.708
Yes...

00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:48.458
it happens without fail.

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:59.750
Suomi! Have the students evacuate and
prepare the counterstrike team immediately!

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.250
Okay!

00:01:07.625 --> 00:01:10.250
They smell worthless.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:15.333
No, none of those smells belong
to the one that I wanna kill.

00:01:24.958 --> 00:01:26.625
That's...

00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:28.125
This is bad.

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:33.458
I didn't want to believe it.

00:01:33.458 --> 00:01:37.958
Jin... You're from the other world after all.

00:01:37.958 --> 00:01:39.667
What?

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:45.042
I'm sorry, but I heard... the message to you.

00:01:46.333 --> 00:01:48.667
What're you two doing?!

00:01:48.667 --> 00:01:50.125
We have to evacuate now!

00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:51.333
Mix! Are you okay?!

00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:52.917
Andy!

00:01:59.292 --> 00:02:01.917
Mix!

00:02:01.917 --> 00:02:04.208
Nooo!

00:02:04.208 --> 00:02:05.500
Yunoha!

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.000
<i>Osore!</i>

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:11.042
<i>Living your life don't give up now</i>
<i>keep moving on</i>

00:02:11.042 --> 00:02:16.667
<i>Kimi o dakishimeru</i>
<i>nando mo nando mo nando mo</i>

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:22.500
<i>Ashita boku wa kimi ni deau darou</i>

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:28.208
<i>Wazuka na hoshi akari o tayori ni</i>

00:02:28.208 --> 00:02:34.292
<i>Boku ni wa kimi ga wakaru yo wakaru yo</i>

00:02:34.292 --> 00:02:44.250
<i>Sen oku no toki o koe </i>
<i>futari hiraku densetsu no tobira</i>

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:50.125
<i>Naraku no ao tobikoete</i>

00:02:50.125 --> 00:02:55.917
<i>Kimi to hai ni naru tame</i>

00:02:55.917 --> 00:03:06.833
<i>Nagaki rinne o</i>
<i>kanashimi tsurete tabi shite kitanda</i>

00:03:06.833 --> 00:03:09.875
<i>Zenryoku de mikansei</i>

00:03:09.875 --> 00:03:12.750
<i>Kimi no tonari de</i>

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:18.583
<i>Kawaita kokoro hodoke chi o nagasu kedo</i>

00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:21.625
<i>Soba ni iru yo zutto</i>

00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:24.500
<i>Yorisotte zutto</i>

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:29.167
<i>Futari hikari no fune ni noru</i>

00:03:29.167 --> 00:03:34.958
<i>Kaze no hajimari no oto kanadeyou (Mezame!)</i>

00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:40.500
"Fallen Giant"
Mithra Gnis is currently destroying the automated batteries!

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.875
"Fallen Giant"
Damage level is at 72%!

00:03:42.875 --> 00:03:45.958
Evacuation of the students is nearly complete.

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:50.250
However, more than
twenty students are missing.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.500
Dammit!

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:55.042
All gates, stand by for takeoff!
All gates, stand by for takeoff!

00:03:55.042 --> 00:03:56.750
That Abductor...

00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:00.292
There's no mistake about it. The pilot is...

00:04:00.292 --> 00:04:02.417
Mikono!

00:04:02.417 --> 00:04:03.875
I promise.

00:04:03.875 --> 00:04:07.958
I'll protect you no matter what happens!

00:04:07.958 --> 00:04:09.458
Amata...

00:04:10.458 --> 00:04:13.458
Thank you. I believe in you.

00:04:13.458 --> 00:04:15.000
Mikono...

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:20.625
Okay, okay, you guys, romance is
prohibited. Romance is prohibited.

00:04:20.625 --> 00:04:21.833
Time to move out!

00:04:21.833 --> 00:04:23.333
Roger!

00:04:26.542 --> 00:04:28.958
We're not gonna let it do
any more damage to our base!

00:04:28.958 --> 00:04:30.250
Geigeki Gattai!

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:32.833
--Go!
--Aquarion!

00:04:37.917 --> 00:04:40.542
Aquarion Evol!

00:04:46.917 --> 00:04:48.667
This smell...

00:04:48.667 --> 00:04:50.417
She's finally come out.

00:04:50.417 --> 00:04:53.750
My... My...

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:56.125
...Silffy!

00:05:01.417 --> 00:05:02.833
He tied into our communication circuits?

00:05:02.833 --> 00:05:05.125
He said "Silffy" just now!

00:05:06.208 --> 00:05:09.083
What's this pain in my heart?

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:21.167
Mugen Punch!

00:05:21.167 --> 00:05:22.958
It won't work!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.375
The Mugen Punch got...

00:05:31.375 --> 00:05:33.333
...rewound?!

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:34.958
What happened?!

00:05:36.708 --> 00:05:39.958
A high-level aura energy is
being detected from Mithra Gnis!

00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:43.208
Could it possibly be... Element power?!

00:05:43.208 --> 00:05:46.542
The pilot of the Abductor is an Element?!

00:05:46.542 --> 00:05:48.250
Can't be!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.042
The power of Reversal...

00:05:50.042 --> 00:05:51.375
Reversal?

00:05:51.375 --> 00:05:54.208
When love changes into hatred,

00:05:54.208 --> 00:05:57.750
all flame gets blocked by ice...

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.750
...and the light turns into darkness!

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:04.083
In other words, an inversion
of the laws of physics...

00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:14.833
Okay...

00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:17.000
Jin?

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.208
You came to?

00:06:19.208 --> 00:06:21.042
Where am I?

00:06:21.042 --> 00:06:22.875
You're coming with me...

00:06:22.875 --> 00:06:23.917
What?

00:06:23.917 --> 00:06:26.917
To Altair... That's right...

00:06:26.917 --> 00:06:30.000
To the world where I live.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.667
Jin?!

00:06:35.875 --> 00:06:40.500
No, I can't. There's no way I could
go when everyone's fighting...

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:44.083
Everyone, who accepted us...

00:06:44.083 --> 00:06:47.083
No. I need you.

00:06:47.083 --> 00:06:52.625
--But...
--I planned this all from the start. Everything!

00:06:52.625 --> 00:06:55.542
In order to snatch the strongest Rare Igura!

00:06:55.542 --> 00:06:58.333
There's no way a person like me is wanted!

00:06:58.333 --> 00:07:00.750
No, let go of me, Jin.

00:07:04.792 --> 00:07:06.583
An emergency has arisen!

00:07:06.583 --> 00:07:08.333
One of the reserved Vector
machines in the hangar

00:07:08.333 --> 00:07:10.042
is about to take off without permission.

00:07:10.042 --> 00:07:11.125
What?!

00:07:11.125 --> 00:07:12.625
Who's the pilot?

00:07:14.958 --> 00:07:18.250
Akbarjin Badbayar! So he really was...

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.792
...an enemy spy!

00:07:19.792 --> 00:07:20.917
No way!

00:07:20.917 --> 00:07:22.958
Seriously?!

00:07:22.958 --> 00:07:25.792
No wonder I thought there was
something gloomy about him.

00:07:25.792 --> 00:07:27.458
I'll go stop him!

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.042
Permission granted.

00:07:31.417 --> 00:07:33.125
Zessica, use your power!

00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:40.292
You're too soft!

00:07:49.708 --> 00:07:51.833
What's with this Abductor?!

00:07:51.833 --> 00:07:53.833
It's not just the strange power.

00:07:53.833 --> 00:07:58.333
It's far stronger than the last time we fought.

00:07:58.333 --> 00:08:00.417
What's that?!

00:08:00.417 --> 00:08:02.333
It's coming from the dimensional gate?

00:08:02.333 --> 00:08:05.583
It seems that high-density energy
is being sent into Mithra Gnis

00:08:05.583 --> 00:08:08.375
in the form of an ethereal tube!

00:08:08.375 --> 00:08:11.333
Then if we could close that dimensional gate...

00:08:11.333 --> 00:08:13.875
...or if we could cut off that tube...

00:08:13.875 --> 00:08:17.375
The red thread of fate...

00:08:17.375 --> 00:08:18.667
The red thread...

00:08:18.667 --> 00:08:20.042
of fate...?

00:08:20.042 --> 00:08:24.042
You, the one weaving this cruel fate...

00:08:24.042 --> 00:08:26.042
Show yourself!

00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:33.333
I see... I'd expect no less from you.
I'm impressed you noticed already...

00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:34.500
What?

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:36.292
Flower petals?

00:08:48.208 --> 00:08:50.250
Teleportation?!

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.042
You are the...

00:08:56.667 --> 00:08:58.167
Jin...

00:08:58.167 --> 00:09:02.208
You've become a lot more cheerful
than you were right after you got here.

00:09:03.333 --> 00:09:05.792
Was that also all planned?

00:09:05.792 --> 00:09:07.417
Shut up!

00:09:07.417 --> 00:09:13.000
But you needed... all of us.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:17.125
In the same way, we all need you, too!

00:09:20.833 --> 00:09:22.583
That...

00:09:27.417 --> 00:09:29.083
...can't be the case!

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:40.917
I was too late!

00:09:40.917 --> 00:09:46.125
It seems that our last child
has also fulfilled his mission.

00:09:46.125 --> 00:09:47.250
Who are you?!

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.542
Oh, no, he's handsome.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:00.042
Stop it right now!

00:10:01.042 --> 00:10:03.125
Donar?! Get a hold of yourself!

00:10:03.125 --> 00:10:04.833
Donar!

00:10:06.792 --> 00:10:09.042
It's been quite a while.

00:10:09.042 --> 00:10:11.917
Has it been ten thousand years
and two thousand more...

00:10:11.917 --> 00:10:16.750
Or has it been twenty thousand
years and four thousand more?

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.542
Fudo?

00:10:18.542 --> 00:10:20.542
So you're finally showing yourself.

00:10:20.542 --> 00:10:26.042
At any rate, what an
unsightly form you've taken.

00:10:26.042 --> 00:10:31.042
Where did you leave your true form?

00:10:31.042 --> 00:10:34.500
The form that reflects in
your eyes is only a spell.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:37.917
In other words, it's a fixation towards the past!

00:10:37.917 --> 00:10:42.875
And look at <i>you</i>, unable to
part with your old form.

00:10:44.583 --> 00:10:48.708
Oh, well... I'll get straight to the point.

00:10:48.708 --> 00:10:52.458
The wing of Apollonius
that shines in an amber hue...

00:10:52.458 --> 00:10:57.917
That's right. I want you to tell me
where the true Solar Wing is.

00:11:06.958 --> 00:11:11.208
Aquarion is...! Please! Let me go!

00:11:11.208 --> 00:11:12.917
Our friends are in danger!

00:11:16.708 --> 00:11:18.583
Jin...

00:11:18.583 --> 00:11:20.208
Please...

00:11:25.708 --> 00:11:27.250
Yunoha...

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.875
I...

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:46.375
Yeah, this smell...

00:11:51.708 --> 00:11:53.250
Reverse!

00:12:02.708 --> 00:12:05.042
Ama... ta?

00:12:09.583 --> 00:12:12.083
My... My...

00:12:12.083 --> 00:12:13.917
...Silffy!

00:12:13.917 --> 00:12:15.167
Silffy?!

00:12:15.167 --> 00:12:16.958
I hate you!

00:12:16.958 --> 00:12:20.708
I've hated you ever since the
moment I first laid eyes on you!

00:12:20.708 --> 00:12:22.583
My Silffy!

00:12:22.583 --> 00:12:25.042
--No! Let me go!
--Silffy?

00:12:25.042 --> 00:12:26.250
Mikono!

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.583
So I'll detest you...

00:12:28.583 --> 00:12:30.167
...and kill you...!

00:12:31.917 --> 00:12:36.125
That's right, in my arms...

00:12:36.125 --> 00:12:37.625
...forever!

00:12:42.083 --> 00:12:43.292
N-No! No!

00:12:43.292 --> 00:12:46.875
Mikono!

00:12:48.917 --> 00:12:50.417
Bastard!

00:12:58.917 --> 00:13:01.333
Mikono!

00:13:01.333 --> 00:13:04.583
Are you the guy from that time?

00:13:04.583 --> 00:13:08.958
The strange guy without any scent...

00:13:08.958 --> 00:13:10.458
What're you talking about?!

00:13:10.458 --> 00:13:15.917
Not having a scent is the same as not existing.

00:13:15.917 --> 00:13:18.750
In other words, it's okay to kill you.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:25.375
I wonder what happens to your heart
if I reverse your blood flow...

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:32.750
Wonderful! You guys are
in a desperate situation.

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:37.250
All your hope has now
disappeared into the darkness.

00:13:38.917 --> 00:13:41.917
Now, answer me.

00:13:41.917 --> 00:13:46.042
My lover for twenty thousand years
and four thousand more...

00:13:46.042 --> 00:13:50.875
Where is... the Solar Wing?

00:13:58.458 --> 00:14:01.708
Oh, yeah... That's right.

00:14:05.708 --> 00:14:10.042
I'm sorry that I forgot about you, Donar Dantes.

00:14:13.917 --> 00:14:15.833
We'll play again.

00:14:22.208 --> 00:14:27.208
It seems like it was a spiritual
body composed by contemplation.

00:14:27.208 --> 00:14:30.500
Miss Suomi. Use the Element
power jammer on the control room.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.000
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:35.125 --> 00:14:37.958
--Don't...!
--Die!

00:14:37.958 --> 00:14:39.458
What?!

00:14:40.833 --> 00:14:42.375
Amata!

00:14:42.375 --> 00:14:43.875
Are you guys okay?!

00:14:45.083 --> 00:14:47.083
Andy! Mix!

00:14:48.375 --> 00:14:52.167
Good! So you guys are okay, too!

00:14:52.167 --> 00:14:54.250
Boy, was I surprised!

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:58.250
I dug a hole and hid in there.
Then she fell on me!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.000
You bastards!

00:15:04.542 --> 00:15:06.875
I'll reverse your lives!

00:15:06.875 --> 00:15:08.875
Go right ahead if you can!

00:15:12.208 --> 00:15:13.750
How dare you?!

00:15:15.375 --> 00:15:16.958
Mikono!

00:15:16.958 --> 00:15:18.875
Cayenne!

00:15:18.875 --> 00:15:21.167
Shrade, too!

00:15:21.167 --> 00:15:23.875
Aquarion! Merge again immediately!

00:15:23.875 --> 00:15:24.875
Roger!

00:15:24.875 --> 00:15:28.708
But unless we do something
about the dimensional gate...

00:15:28.708 --> 00:15:30.333
The power to cut off!

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:35.458
If I use my power...!

00:15:35.458 --> 00:15:37.250
--What?
--You...

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.958
Akbarjin Badbayar! You are...

00:15:39.958 --> 00:15:42.250
No.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:45.458
My name is Jin Musou.

00:15:45.458 --> 00:15:48.125
You're a spy! Now you
suddenly want to help us?!

00:15:48.125 --> 00:15:50.542
Please trust him!

00:15:50.542 --> 00:15:54.667
He is our friend!

00:15:54.667 --> 00:15:58.167
Don't be deceived by him, Yunoha!

00:15:58.167 --> 00:16:01.958
If you can't trust me, that's fine. But...

00:16:01.958 --> 00:16:04.875
...unless we use the power to cut off,

00:16:04.875 --> 00:16:07.500
the power I gained after I came to this world,

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:10.042
you can't close Altair's dimensional gate!

00:16:10.042 --> 00:16:11.792
B-But...

00:16:11.792 --> 00:16:13.875
So, please let me merge, too!

00:16:15.333 --> 00:16:17.833
Love crosses the planets, huh?

00:16:17.833 --> 00:16:19.333
Mykage?!

00:16:23.042 --> 00:16:28.250
For your betrayal, you will
pay a high price in love.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.333
Stop it!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.500
Yunoha!

00:16:42.042 --> 00:16:43.542
Jin?!

00:16:44.875 --> 00:16:46.375
Jin!

00:16:48.417 --> 00:16:52.375
I'm okay. I won't be defeated
by a figure of contemplation!

00:16:52.375 --> 00:16:54.375
Jin!

00:16:54.375 --> 00:16:56.625
So let's merge! Now!

00:17:00.958 --> 00:17:03.625
Okay then, Jin! Let's merge!

00:17:06.042 --> 00:17:08.417
Amata! Mikono! Rendan Gattai!

00:17:08.417 --> 00:17:10.750
--Go!
--Aquarion!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.875
--Houen Gattai!
--Go!

00:17:12.875 --> 00:17:14.833
Aquarion!

00:17:29.542 --> 00:17:31.083
We can understand each other!

00:17:32.417 --> 00:17:37.458
Whoa...! These are, indeed,
two harmonious sounds!

00:17:37.458 --> 00:17:40.250
Incredible! The power welling up...

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:42.417
...crosses the two planets!

00:17:42.417 --> 00:17:43.833
This is...

00:17:43.833 --> 00:17:46.083
--...our...
--...our...

00:17:46.083 --> 00:17:47.792
...Gattai!

00:17:47.792 --> 00:17:50.375
Aquarion Gepart!

00:17:51.583 --> 00:17:54.417
Aquarion Spada!

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:03.375
Incredible!

00:18:03.375 --> 00:18:05.792
Nice sound, my good friend!

00:18:23.083 --> 00:18:25.333
Playtime is over!

00:18:38.167 --> 00:18:40.000
What a sound!

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.583
We won't last long like this!

00:18:42.583 --> 00:18:44.292
Yunoha!

00:18:44.292 --> 00:18:46.583
The Elements' aura levels are going down!

00:18:46.583 --> 00:18:48.583
Their bio waves are unstable!

00:18:48.583 --> 00:18:50.833
Their lives are...

00:18:50.833 --> 00:18:52.500
Damn you, Kagura!

00:18:55.042 --> 00:18:57.625
Jin... Your wound from earlier...

00:18:57.625 --> 00:19:02.042
I don't care! I don't ever
want to see them again...

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:07.292
Your tears.

00:19:11.042 --> 00:19:12.583
Jin!

00:19:21.125 --> 00:19:22.792
Yunoha?

00:19:22.792 --> 00:19:24.333
I'm with you!

00:19:30.208 --> 00:19:31.542
Jin!

00:19:31.542 --> 00:19:32.708
Jin!

00:19:32.708 --> 00:19:35.375
Jin!

00:19:35.375 --> 00:19:36.958
Everyone!

00:19:41.417 --> 00:19:43.167
They're getting connected...

00:19:48.083 --> 00:19:49.583
What?!

00:19:52.958 --> 00:19:54.583
That light...

00:19:54.583 --> 00:19:58.875
Crossing planets, powers connect
and become infinite!

00:20:05.333 --> 00:20:10.167
Incredible! Gepart is calling for new weapons!

00:20:10.167 --> 00:20:11.958
Gepart is evolving?!

00:20:11.958 --> 00:20:14.167
This is Jin's...

00:20:14.167 --> 00:20:17.708
We'll stop our enemy with Spada.
Here we go, my good friends!

00:20:17.708 --> 00:20:19.208
Roger!

00:20:38.625 --> 00:20:39.792
Now...

00:20:39.792 --> 00:20:41.375
...in order to cut...

00:20:41.375 --> 00:20:43.083
...the evil power...

00:20:43.083 --> 00:20:45.667
Go!

00:20:51.542 --> 00:20:54.292
A dimension-shutting field...!

00:20:54.292 --> 00:20:56.042
We're gonna finish it off, Amata, Mikono!

00:20:56.042 --> 00:20:57.208
Okay!

00:20:57.208 --> 00:20:58.792
Together, let us play...

00:20:58.792 --> 00:21:01.250
...an interruzione of melody!

00:21:10.333 --> 00:21:12.500
Reverse!

00:21:17.958 --> 00:21:19.458
Mikono!

00:21:34.792 --> 00:21:37.458
Now! Finishing Refrain!

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:40.500
What?!

00:21:50.917 --> 00:21:55.208
The dimensional gate has been cut off!
Both Gepart and Spada are okay!

00:22:10.667 --> 00:22:12.458
We did it, Jin!

00:22:16.042 --> 00:22:17.417
Jin?

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:25.583
Yunoha...

00:22:25.583 --> 00:22:30.125
I'm nearly breathless at
the miracle of our meeting.

00:22:31.875 --> 00:22:38.042
Holding your hand in mine makes me
feel like I can be a bit stronger.

00:22:38.042 --> 00:22:39.583
So...

00:22:41.375 --> 00:22:45.917
Nooo!

00:22:52.583 --> 00:22:58.042
<i>Kaze ni ubawareta wake janai</i>

00:22:58.042 --> 00:23:00.917
<i>Katamichi bun no yuuki de</i>

00:23:00.917 --> 00:23:08.708
<i>Bokura higeki o ukeireru</i>

00:23:08.708 --> 00:23:13.417
<i>Kokoro ga koko ni atta hazu no kuudou</i>

00:23:13.417 --> 00:23:16.000
<i>Motto boku ga ookikereba</i>

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:21.667
<i>Kimi o mirai o sukueta darou ka</i>

00:23:21.667 --> 00:23:29.000
<i>Taisetsu na hito o mamoru sube o</i>
<i>tatta hitotsu shika motanai</i>

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:35.833
<i>Sonna anata ga hagure tadayou sora</i>

00:23:35.833 --> 00:23:43.542
<i>Anata ijou no hito ni deaenai</i>

00:23:43.542 --> 00:23:50.000
<i>Tsuki ni aragau nagai furea</i>

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:56.542
<i>Hajimari mo sezu owaru monogatari</i>

00:23:56.542 --> 00:24:02.500
<i>Kizutsukiuru yawarakasa tojikometa senritsu</i>

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.542
<i>Kanaderu hodo utau hodo</i>

00:24:05.542 --> 00:24:11.042
<i>Kowareru hodo ni</i>

00:24:11.042 --> 00:24:17.958
<i>Anataga koishii</i>

00:24:19.708 --> 00:24:25.458
I want to disappear into the spring wind
and dissolve into the summer darkness.

00:24:25.458 --> 00:24:27.958
You're reflected on the fall moon,

00:24:30.167 --> 00:24:31.208
"Next Episode 'Beyond an Individual'"
but the winter snow covers and hides you.

00:24:31.208 --> 00:24:33.375
"Next Episode 'Beyond an Individual'"
The seasons you're not around...
